The '''Salto Bay Bridge''' ({{Lang-bl|Ponte de la Bahía de Salto}}), known locally as the '''Bay Bridge''' ({{Lang-bl|Ponte de la Bahía}}), is a complex of bridges spanning [[Salto Bay]] in the [[Alpujarra]]. As part of [[Autopista 22|''Autopista'' 22]] and the direct road link between [[Ampurias]] and [[Trinacria]], it carries about 150,000 vehicles a day on its top deck and x trains per day on the lower deck. 

